# New Partner Onboarding Script Generator

Generate complete onboarding SQL scripts for a new AA2.0 partner.

## Input
Partner Name: {PARTNER_NAME}
Access_Party_ID: {PARTNER_ID}
Plan_Key(s): {PLAN_KEYS}
Traunch_ID: {TRAUNCH_ID}
Access Start Date: {START_DATE}
Partner Warehouse Name: WH_{PARTNER_NAME}
Partner Connection String: {CONNECTION_STRING}
Partner Warehouse ID: {WAREHOUSE_ID}
Partner Workspace ID: {WORKSPACE_ID}

## Generate All of the Following

### 1. Oracle DML (DBA runs this in Oracle)
- INSERT into UIIDWP01.T_DW_ACCESS_PARTY
- INSERT into UIIDWP01.T_DW_ACCESS_CONTROL
  (one row per Plan_Key)

### 2. WH_Metadata INSERT — PartnerMaster (1 row)
INSERT into Partner.PartnerMaster

### 3. WH_Metadata INSERT — ConfigMaster (35 rows)
INSERT into Partner.ConfigMaster
SELECT all 35 TableIds from Partner.TableDefinition
WaterMarkValue = '2021-08-01' (first full load start)
IsActive = 1

### 4. Verification Queries
- SELECT from Partner.PartnerMaster WHERE PartnerId = {PARTNER_ID}
- SELECT COUNT(*) from Partner.ConfigMaster WHERE PartnerId = {PARTNER_ID}
- Expected: 1 row in PartnerMaster, 35 rows in ConfigMaster

### 5. Post-Run Verification
- Query Metadata.Log in new partner warehouse
- Expected: 35 SUCCESS rows after pipeline run
